      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use case: CPU=20% (reactive says stable) BUT queue_depth=1200\n→ App is I/O-bound not CPU-bound, workers overwhelmed with queued work\n→ queue_depth(1200) > threshold(1000) → Layer 2 triggers scale-up despite low CPU\n→ Prevents SLA breach that reactive-only autoscalers miss",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": "case",
      "originalText": "Use case: CPU=20% (reactive says stable) BUT queue_depth=1200\n→ App is I/O-bound not CPU-bound, workers overwhelmed with queued work\n→ queue_depth(1200) > threshold(1000) → Layer 2 triggers scale-up despite low CPU\n→ Prevents SLA breach that reactive-only autoscalers miss"
